"QCOM":[{"topic":"revenue","text":"Revenue was $43.1 billion in FY2026, down 2.6% from FY2025. In FY2015 it was $25.3 billion: the FY2026 figure is 1.7 times that.","cites":["QCOM.revenue.2026","QCOM.revenue.2025","QCOM.revenue.2015"]},{"topic":"margin","text":"Gross margin was 53.1% in FY2026 (revenue less cost of revenue ÷ revenue), against 57.5% in FY2021. The highest in the years shown was 64.6%, in FY2019.","cites":["QCOM.revenue.2026","QCOM.cost.2026","QCOM.revenue.2021","QCOM.cost.2021","QCOM.revenue.2019","QCOM.cost.2019"]},{"topic":"rd","text":"Research and development took 23.7% of revenue in FY2026 ($10.2 billion), against 21.4% in FY2021.","cites":["QCOM.rd.2026","QCOM.revenue.2026","QCOM.rd.2021","QCOM.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $2.5 billion in FY2026, 5.8% of revenue; in FY2021 it was $1.9 billion, 5.6%.","cites":["QCOM.capex.2026","QCOM.revenue.2026","QCOM.capex.2021","QCOM.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2026 was $8.6 billion, about 156 days of cost of revenue.","cites":["QCOM.inventory.2026","QCOM.cost.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2026 was China (including Hong Kong): $18.1 billion, 42% of revenue.","cites":["QCOM.mix.geography.2026.0","QCOM.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Customer/licensee (x)” at 22% of revenue.","cites":["QCOM.conc.2026.0"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Customer Y” at 20% of revenue.","cites":["QCOM.conc.2026.1"]}]}}